T1  - Lower Limb Muscle Activities and Contractility During Stepping Response to Unexpected Waist-Pull Perturbations
TI  - Lower Limb Muscle Activities and Contractility During Stepping Response to Unexpected Waist-Pull Perturbations
AU  - O. Akinniyi
AU  - M. Gainey
